# dotenvx private key file - intentionally EMPTY of secrets.
#
# A real private key was previously committed in this file. The value has
# been removed from the working tree. That is NOT sufficient: any copy in
# Git history must still be purged, and the key itself must be treated as
# compromised and rotated/revoked BEFORE production launch.
#
# See SECURITY.md and the "Secret rotation (required before launch)"
# section of LAUNCH.md for the exact runbook.
#
# Real dotenvx keys are never stored in this repository. All secrets
# (private keys, JWT values, deployment credentials) are configured through
# the deployment secrets manager - the project Keys/API keys UI, Convex
# environment variables, or Vercel Environment Variables - never in Git.
